WEBVTT


00:00:10.173 --> 00:00:13.336
Dare not go easy on me
because I am the King!


00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.834
How will you cut down
the enemies like this?


00:01:09.065 --> 00:01:11.727
The sword must move with soul,
not technique!


00:01:12.768 --> 00:01:15.134
No use reading on
military tactics all night.


00:01:15.671 --> 00:01:17.730
The problem is your heart.


00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:28.410
You are
Chief of the Kunryongwe.


00:01:29.051 --> 00:01:32.214
Show me true loyalty
from the heart.


00:01:54.877 --> 00:01:58.210
Minister KI, Lord CHO, and others
are gathered at Wonheung Temple.


00:01:58.948 --> 00:01:59.607
What?


00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:01.910
I think there's something big
going down, sir.


00:02:02.451 --> 00:02:05.113
Lord Tae-Ahn is there, too.


00:02:23.272 --> 00:02:26.639
I'm very grateful
for all your help.


00:02:27.176 --> 00:02:28.143
Especially,


00:02:28.277 --> 00:02:30.711
Lord Tae-Ahn for his willingness
to join our cause.


00:02:30.846 --> 00:02:33.110
When the Emperor sees this...


00:02:33.249 --> 00:02:36.013
it will be of great help
to Lord Kyungwon.


00:02:36.152 --> 00:02:37.414
Lord Tae-Ahn.


00:02:38.254 --> 00:02:41.018
You've done much
for our country.


00:02:57.873 --> 00:02:58.931
Who's there?


00:03:00.576 --> 00:03:02.544
Get down from your horse.


00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:04.612
- Run, sir.
- Okay.


00:03:44.253 --> 00:03:45.618
Your Majesty.


00:03:49.058 --> 00:03:50.525
What happened?


00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.925
He confessed everything, sire.


00:03:56.465 --> 00:04:00.834
The Lord Kyungwon's
secret envoy had this.


00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:19.010
Everyone who signed here
plotted to kill me?


00:04:21.757 --> 00:04:23.918
Yes, Your Majesty.


00:04:26.262 --> 00:04:28.730
What of the Queen's brother?


00:04:30.566 --> 00:04:34.229
Lord Tae-Ahn also conspired
to enthrone Lord Kyungwon.


00:04:35.671 --> 00:04:38.333
There's not one man I can trust.


00:05:06.469 --> 00:05:09.336
I'll have a banquet in few days.


00:05:10.372 --> 00:05:15.639
And cut all of their heads there.


00:05:17.446 --> 00:05:24.511
But I'll not let Tae-Ahn die in
the banquet because of Queen.


00:05:26.555 --> 00:05:29.217
You're going to kill him
in his house.


00:05:33.062 --> 00:05:35.724
All rise for His Majesty the King.


00:05:45.774 --> 00:05:47.833
You may all be seated.


00:05:52.648 --> 00:05:55.116
I've arranged this banquet today...


00:05:55.551 --> 00:06:01.615
to celebrate the victory of
our troops dispatched to Yuan.


00:06:02.057 --> 00:06:05.823
Though they are fighting for
a foreign country...


00:06:06.362 --> 00:06:10.628
they stand bravely at the front,
showing the valor of our army.


00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.031
Tis comforting somewhat.


00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.028
Now.


00:06:17.273 --> 00:06:22.233
Let us drink to
our soldier's safe return!


00:06:23.078 --> 00:06:26.309
Hail, our gracious King!


00:06:29.652 --> 00:06:31.017
Check your weapons.


00:06:31.353 --> 00:06:33.913
And remember
who you're assigned to.


00:06:56.679 --> 00:07:00.809
Lord CHO, how about telling
His Majesty a good sentence?


00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.417
What a good day!


00:07:03.652 --> 00:07:09.318
No, I think
Minister KI should do that.


00:07:10.159 --> 00:07:11.820
Okay.


00:07:13.662 --> 00:07:14.924
Your Majesty?


00:07:15.364 --> 00:07:17.127
I, KI Wong-Hong...


00:07:17.266 --> 00:07:21.327
would like to say something
on this euphoric day.


00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:26.737
I wish you to bear an heir
and live a long life, sire.


00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:31.505
Thank you.
I wish you a long life as well.


00:07:31.647 --> 00:07:34.514
Hail, my gracious King.


00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:41.817
Now, let us all toast
to the King!


00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.621
Long live the King!


00:07:57.473 --> 00:07:59.441
Stop the music!


00:08:17.159 --> 00:08:19.127
Your attention!


00:08:19.461 --> 00:08:23.921
With Goryeo's fall
as a tributary state to Yuan...


00:08:24.066 --> 00:08:27.229
I've endured much humiliation
and disgrace.


00:08:27.369 --> 00:08:31.032
I trust you all feel
the same as I do.


00:08:31.573 --> 00:08:33.234
But, within this room...


00:08:34.276 --> 00:08:38.212
there are some who take pride
in being puppets to Yuan.


00:08:40.049 --> 00:08:44.008
As our young men are dying
in the savage land...


00:08:45.054 --> 00:08:47.818
they believe
it should be celebrated.


00:08:48.557 --> 00:08:50.320
Here today!


00:08:50.959 --> 00:08:54.122
I shall rid of all such traitors!


00:08:54.663 --> 00:08:57.223
And set the court right!


00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:02.832
Kill them!


00:09:23.459 --> 00:09:26.724
Kill off every one of them!


00:09:30.866 --> 00:09:32.128
Out of my way!


00:09:48.751 --> 00:09:55.623
Your Majesty... Please...


00:10:30.659 --> 00:10:32.217
Listen carefully.


00:10:33.061 --> 00:10:36.622
I just executed
a group of conspirators.


00:10:37.666 --> 00:10:42.729
But Lord Tae-Ahn was
also among them.


00:10:44.273 --> 00:10:45.240
Pardon?


00:10:45.974 --> 00:10:47.737
Your brother...


00:10:49.077 --> 00:10:51.511
He was among
the group of collaborators.


00:10:51.947 --> 00:10:55.405
What are you saying, sire?


00:10:55.551 --> 00:10:57.212
Lord Tae-Ahn...


00:10:58.754 --> 00:11:01.416
Chief HONG went to
execute him, now.


00:11:06.161 --> 00:11:07.423
Chief HONG!


00:11:09.565 --> 00:11:11.533
I am the Queen's brother!


00:11:11.667 --> 00:11:13.430
Though
I may have done wrong...


00:11:13.569 --> 00:11:16.436
how can the King have me killed?


00:11:16.572 --> 00:11:21.134
Take the King's orders in stride,
like a royal family.


00:11:25.747 --> 00:11:27.908
Chief HONG!


00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:31.017
Why would I have signed it?


00:11:31.153 --> 00:11:35.112
It's because I was worried
about her future.


00:11:35.257 --> 00:11:38.420
For the sake of the Queen...


00:11:38.861 --> 00:11:42.319
Please do not kill me.


00:11:48.871 --> 00:11:50.736
I did what you want me to do.


00:11:51.273 --> 00:11:53.332
He accepted it?


00:11:55.277 --> 00:11:56.244
Yes.


00:12:03.452 --> 00:12:04.817
Good job.


00:12:26.375 --> 00:12:28.639
What happened to my brother?


00:12:30.078 --> 00:12:31.511
Answer me.


00:12:33.348 --> 00:12:36.112
Did you really kill my brother
with your own hands?


00:12:38.053 --> 00:12:39.918
Lord Tae-Ahn is alive.


00:12:41.056 --> 00:12:42.023
What?


00:12:43.659 --> 00:12:48.722
He and his family are
headed for Yuan now


00:12:49.865 --> 00:12:51.332
Is that true?


00:12:54.369 --> 00:12:55.427
Yes.


00:13:00.976 --> 00:13:01.943
Cover it.


00:13:03.745 --> 00:13:06.805
No need to bring me his head.


00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.515
Forgive me, sire.


00:13:20.862 --> 00:13:22.830
Chief HONG...


00:13:23.966 --> 00:13:26.230
Did he truly let
Lord Tae-Ahn go?


00:13:26.368 --> 00:13:29.337
I saw with my own eyes, sire.


00:13:37.145 --> 00:13:39.613
I've asked you both here...


00:13:40.449 --> 00:13:43.612
to discuss and conclude
our postponed matter.


00:13:44.353 --> 00:13:47.220
Things have stabilized.


00:13:48.857 --> 00:13:52.224
So, I'd like to resume
the consummation.


00:13:56.865 --> 00:13:58.730
What do you think, my Queen?


00:13:59.368 --> 00:14:01.427
Why all of a sudden, sire?


00:14:04.473 --> 00:14:09.843
I'm resuming what was postponed.
Why be so surprised?


00:14:13.548 --> 00:14:18.508
But, your partner
will not be HONG Lim this time.


00:14:21.656 --> 00:14:23.021
It's Seung-Ki.


00:14:26.161 --> 00:14:28.823
The result was not good
with HONG Lim.


00:14:29.364 --> 00:14:31.924
Seung-Ki is also one of my
most trusted men.


00:14:32.067 --> 00:14:34.627
I hope you understand.


00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.529
Have you gone mad, sir?


00:14:38.373 --> 00:14:41.035
How can you humiliate me so?


00:14:41.176 --> 00:14:42.939
This cannot be, Your Majesty.


00:14:43.478 --> 00:14:45.503
Why are you doing this, sire?


00:14:45.647 --> 00:14:46.807
HONG Lim...


00:14:47.949 --> 00:14:53.216
Do you really not know why
I made such decision?


00:15:00.762 --> 00:15:02.127
It's a royal order.


00:15:03.065 --> 00:15:07.434
I will set
the consummation date soon.


00:15:28.356 --> 00:15:29.414
Who is it?


00:15:39.768 --> 00:15:41.030
Let's leave the palace.


00:15:44.973 --> 00:15:47.237
Anywhere,
if we can leave the palace.


00:15:47.375 --> 00:15:49.536
Let's run away from here!


00:15:49.678 --> 00:15:54.206
Please calm down, Your Majesty.


00:15:54.349 --> 00:15:57.614
Where do you want to go?
Yuan? Hide in the hills?


00:15:58.053 --> 00:15:59.816
III follow you anywhere.


00:15:59.955 --> 00:16:04.221
Take me away from here, please.


00:16:08.763 --> 00:16:10.230
Please go back.


00:16:11.166 --> 00:16:15.125
If he finds out you're here,
your life will be in danger.


00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:16.532
It doesn't matter.


00:16:16.972 --> 00:16:19.236
I have nothing more
to be afraid of now.


00:16:21.977 --> 00:16:23.342
But, I am afraid.


00:16:26.648 --> 00:16:28.912
Do not come for me again.


00:16:33.054 --> 00:16:37.616
I will live only as
the King's subject from now on.


00:16:56.778 --> 00:16:57.904
Your Majesty.


00:16:59.948 --> 00:17:01.813
I deserve to die.


00:17:04.653 --> 00:17:12.025
I was blinded by foolish desires
and betrayed and humiliated you.


00:17:17.465 --> 00:17:20.332
This is the very sword
you granted me.


00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:25.139
Please take my life with it.


00:17:27.275 --> 00:17:30.039
I shall seek your forgiveness
in death.


00:17:38.053 --> 00:17:41.318
You've given away something
more precious than life.


00:17:43.058 --> 00:17:47.427
What good would it do
to take your life, now?


00:18:16.858 --> 00:18:19.224
Has Chief HONG
retired to his room?


00:18:19.761 --> 00:18:22.229
He is still
in the back garden, sire.


00:18:56.665 --> 00:18:59.725
Luckily, she will be fine.


00:19:00.468 --> 00:19:02.834
No need to worry, Your Majesty.


00:19:11.246 --> 00:19:13.305
I will ask you just one thing.


00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:21.721
Your liaisons with the Queen...


00:19:26.361 --> 00:19:29.819
Was it all impulsive lust?


00:19:32.467 --> 00:19:33.627
Yes.


00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.637
Your Majesty.


00:19:43.478 --> 00:19:46.709
Go serve at the border
in a few weeks.


00:19:48.149 --> 00:19:53.018
It will help you forget about
everything here.


00:20:07.769 --> 00:20:10.033
You didn't sleep all night.


00:20:11.072 --> 00:20:13.233
Stay and rest.


00:21:01.956 --> 00:21:04.720
Your tunes
have become rather dull.


00:21:08.563 --> 00:21:10.724
Do it again.


00:22:07.956 --> 00:22:10.220
Do you know where this is?


00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.025
Where is it, sire?


00:22:16.164 --> 00:22:21.625
I dreamt of hunting through
the Liao Dong plains with you.


00:22:22.971 --> 00:22:26.737
It was so vivid,
I wanted to paint it.


00:22:32.146 --> 00:22:36.014
Then that is me riding behind?


00:22:38.152 --> 00:22:41.519
Why? Do you not like it?


00:22:46.461 --> 00:22:48.929
Perhaps it would be better...


00:22:49.664 --> 00:22:51.529
if I was shooting an arrow, too.


00:22:52.667 --> 00:22:57.229
Now that you mention it,
that'll suit better...


00:23:00.975 --> 00:23:03.136
Are you leaving tomorrow?


00:23:04.445 --> 00:23:05.503
Yes, sire.


00:23:06.748 --> 00:23:10.616
Our soldiers dispatched to Yuan
will be returning in two weeks.


00:23:11.352 --> 00:23:13.820
I will hold a big banquet.


00:23:15.256 --> 00:23:17.315
Why don't you leave
after that?


00:23:18.259 --> 00:23:19.624
No, sire.


00:23:20.762 --> 00:23:23.526
I will leave as scheduled.


00:23:44.252 --> 00:23:45.310
Who is it?


00:23:45.653 --> 00:23:49.612
Chief HONG?
It's me Bo-Duk.


00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:53.322
What is it?


00:23:54.062 --> 00:23:56.223
I have something urgent to tell you.


00:23:59.567 --> 00:24:01.034
Go back.


00:24:08.276 --> 00:24:12.303
I'm so sorry. Chief Hong.


00:24:12.847 --> 00:24:14.508
I said Go back.


00:24:14.849 --> 00:24:18.216
The Queen wants to see you.


00:24:19.954 --> 00:24:21.421
I don't want to.


00:24:21.956 --> 00:24:26.017
Please, just one time.


00:24:26.361 --> 00:24:28.226
Please.


00:24:43.277 --> 00:24:44.505
I cannot see her.


00:24:45.847 --> 00:24:47.007
Just go.


00:24:47.448 --> 00:24:48.710
But Chief...


00:24:49.651 --> 00:24:54.111
The Queen has conceived.


00:25:58.052 --> 00:25:59.713
It's been a long time.


00:26:21.776 --> 00:26:23.243
I'm so sorry.


00:26:31.552 --> 00:26:38.219
I was troubled whether to tell you
just before your departure.


00:26:40.161 --> 00:26:42.220
Does His Majesty know?


00:26:43.464 --> 00:26:45.432
I haven't told him yet.


00:26:46.267 --> 00:26:49.532
I doubt he'll welcome
this child, now.


00:26:50.571 --> 00:26:53.233
I fear it will
only harm the child.


00:26:54.475 --> 00:26:56.136
No, Your Majesty.


00:26:56.944 --> 00:27:01.711
The King will truly accept
the child as his own.


00:27:10.158 --> 00:27:12.626
Please keep strong.


00:27:13.561 --> 00:27:15.620
I shall be going, then.


00:27:23.771 --> 00:27:25.033
HONG Lim.


00:28:46.854 --> 00:28:48.321
Secretary HWANG?


00:28:48.456 --> 00:28:49.718
Yes, Your Majesty?


00:28:50.458 --> 00:28:53.120
Where are
the military tactic books stored?


00:30:41.669 --> 00:30:42.829
You!


00:30:43.871 --> 00:30:46.931
How could you humiliate
me like this!


00:30:47.475 --> 00:30:50.137
And you call yourself a man!


00:30:50.745 --> 00:30:52.804
What did you promise me?


00:30:54.148 --> 00:30:56.708
You said you'll never
meet her again!


00:30:57.151 --> 00:30:58.209
But...


00:30:59.854 --> 00:31:02.414
How can you do this to me!


00:31:07.461 --> 00:31:08.621
Queen.


00:31:10.464 --> 00:31:12.728
What should I do with him?


00:31:14.068 --> 00:31:16.332
That lewd fool!


00:31:17.872 --> 00:31:20.136
What shall I do with him?


00:31:23.544 --> 00:31:25.512
Say something!


00:31:26.547 --> 00:31:29.209
'Tis all my fault, sire.


00:31:29.850 --> 00:31:33.115
My affections for him
led me to seduce him.


00:31:34.455 --> 00:31:36.616
Punish me instead, sire.


00:31:37.058 --> 00:31:38.320
No, Your Majesty!


00:31:39.960 --> 00:31:42.019
The Queen is without fault!


00:31:44.065 --> 00:31:47.523
I sought her,
unable to fight my love for her.


00:31:48.369 --> 00:31:50.337
Take my life, sire.


00:31:56.277 --> 00:31:57.301
What?


00:31:58.646 --> 00:32:00.511
Did I hear love?


00:32:06.153 --> 00:32:10.715
Did you... say
you love the Queen?


00:32:11.859 --> 00:32:12.917
Yes.


00:32:15.763 --> 00:32:17.321
I love her.


00:32:21.569 --> 00:32:23.537
Say it again.


00:32:24.572 --> 00:32:28.235
Did you just say
you're in love with the Queen?


00:32:32.046 --> 00:32:33.104
Yes.


00:32:34.548 --> 00:32:36.709
I love the Queen.


00:32:38.853 --> 00:32:42.516
You've gone mad with lust!


00:32:43.557 --> 00:32:44.717
Sub-Chief!


00:32:46.961 --> 00:32:47.928
Yes, Your Majesty.


00:32:49.363 --> 00:32:50.830
Have him castrated!


00:32:54.368 --> 00:32:55.426
But sire...


00:32:55.569 --> 00:32:58.538
Cut it off at once!


00:33:00.674 --> 00:33:01.641
Your Majesty...


00:33:02.176 --> 00:33:04.701
What are you waiting for!
Cut it off!


00:33:04.845 --> 00:33:06.506
Please, Your Majesty!


00:33:06.847 --> 00:33:08.212
Kill me, Your Majesty!


00:33:08.349 --> 00:33:10.214
Kill me, Your Majesty!


00:33:11.051 --> 00:33:13.815
Forgive him, sire!
I'll never meet him again.


00:33:13.954 --> 00:33:15.922
Just kill me instead!


00:33:16.056 --> 00:33:19.219
Forgive him, please!
It'll never happen again!


00:33:19.360 --> 00:33:20.224
Your Majesty!


00:33:20.361 --> 00:33:23.125
No! No!
Your Majesty!


00:33:23.264 --> 00:33:26.233
- I'd rather die, sire!
- Forgive me, sire!


00:33:27.868 --> 00:33:31.326
Kill me instead!


00:33:31.472 --> 00:33:33.633
Castrate him now!


00:33:35.376 --> 00:33:36.434
Sire!


00:33:37.945 --> 00:33:40.106
Please don't!


00:33:40.247 --> 00:33:41.214
Sire!


00:33:41.348 --> 00:33:43.816
No, Your Majesty!


00:33:47.855 --> 00:33:49.015
Sire!


00:33:50.157 --> 00:33:51.317
Your Majesty!


00:34:55.856 --> 00:34:57.323
Your Majesty.


00:34:57.858 --> 00:35:00.418
I have an urgent matter
to inform you.


00:35:03.564 --> 00:35:05.031
What is it?


00:35:09.570 --> 00:35:11.128
Your Majesty...


00:35:11.272 --> 00:35:13.240
Congratulations, sir.


00:35:13.774 --> 00:35:17.505
The Queen
has finally conceived!


00:35:19.546 --> 00:35:26.008
The long awaited heir
has finally come.


00:35:27.154 --> 00:35:31.113
What a blessing
for the royal family, sire.


00:35:43.070 --> 00:35:47.131
I need you to do something.


00:35:47.274 --> 00:35:48.536
Yes, Your Majesty.


00:35:50.077 --> 00:35:52.307
The Queen has conceived a child.


00:35:52.846 --> 00:35:53.813
Sire?


00:35:55.349 --> 00:36:01.310
You know very well
whose child it is.


00:36:02.356 --> 00:36:05.223
For that child to become
truly mine...


00:36:07.361 --> 00:36:09.329
What should be done?


00:36:16.370 --> 00:36:18.429
When the night falls...


00:36:19.773 --> 00:36:21.741
eliminate everyone involved.


00:36:23.177 --> 00:36:24.201
Yes, Your Majesty.


00:36:26.947 --> 00:36:30.314
But, what about chief Hong?


00:36:51.071 --> 00:36:54.131
Now we're same.


00:36:56.844 --> 00:37:02.214
Who would find you,
if I'm don't.


00:37:04.351 --> 00:37:06.410
I suggest a simple thing.


00:37:07.855 --> 00:37:10.016
Let's get back to the first place.


00:37:11.358 --> 00:37:16.421
If you come back,
I'll give you everything.


00:37:20.467 --> 00:37:22.731
Even this country.


00:37:31.745 --> 00:37:34.509
I must save Chief HONG.


00:37:34.848 --> 00:37:37.612
Do you know why the King
summoned me earlier?


00:37:38.152 --> 00:37:40.712
He said he'll accept
this child as his.


00:37:44.958 --> 00:37:47.620
How can there be two fathers?


00:37:49.363 --> 00:37:51.524
The moment this child
becomes the royal heir...


00:37:51.665 --> 00:37:54.327
everyone who
knows of this will die.


00:37:56.370 --> 00:37:58.429
Quickly, take this to Han-Baek.


00:37:58.572 --> 00:38:01.234
And follow Chief HONG to
Eunjung Temple.


00:38:01.775 --> 00:38:05.211
But, Your Majesty...


00:38:06.547 --> 00:38:09.311
if the King accepts
this child as his...


00:38:09.450 --> 00:38:12.214
will you not be safe?


00:38:12.853 --> 00:38:15.617
Why bring calamity upon yourself?


00:38:17.357 --> 00:38:18.722
There is no time.


00:38:19.259 --> 00:38:20.317
Go, now!


00:38:21.261 --> 00:38:22.421
Your Majesty...


00:38:33.073 --> 00:38:34.233
No! Please!


00:39:03.971 --> 00:39:04.938
Chief!


00:39:05.272 --> 00:39:06.239
Chief!


00:39:08.775 --> 00:39:09.742
Chief...


00:39:14.648 --> 00:39:16.206
Let's get out of here.


00:39:16.350 --> 00:39:18.011
Wear this.


00:39:19.653 --> 00:39:21.120
How did you come here?


00:39:21.255 --> 00:39:23.416
The Queen told us.


00:39:25.259 --> 00:39:26.226
What?


00:39:26.760 --> 00:39:29.228
We have to get out of here first.
Hurry up.


00:39:30.564 --> 00:39:31.724
The Queen?


00:39:32.165 --> 00:39:33.132
What are you talking about?


00:39:33.267 --> 00:39:35.633
Please stand up.
We don't have time.


00:39:37.871 --> 00:39:39.031
How's she?


00:39:39.773 --> 00:39:41.434
How is the Queen?


00:39:41.975 --> 00:39:44.205
The Queen went out of palace.


00:40:08.268 --> 00:40:09.633
Forgive me, sire.


00:40:25.352 --> 00:40:26.512
Chief!


00:40:29.856 --> 00:40:32.017
Are you okay, sir?


00:40:32.159 --> 00:40:33.820
Hurry! Take him inside.


00:40:36.964 --> 00:40:38.124
Where is the Queen?


00:40:39.066 --> 00:40:40.033
What?


00:40:40.367 --> 00:40:42.130
Where is the Queen?


00:40:42.769 --> 00:40:44.031
The Queen?


00:40:46.273 --> 00:40:48.434
Didn't you bring her with you?


00:40:49.576 --> 00:40:51.510
What are you saying, sir?


00:40:51.645 --> 00:40:54.113
The Queen is not here, Chief.


00:40:54.948 --> 00:40:56.006
What?


00:40:57.050 --> 00:41:00.110
Forgive us.
We lied to you.


00:41:16.670 --> 00:41:18.331
Here is HONG Lim?


00:41:20.073 --> 00:41:21.335
I do not know, sire.


00:41:24.244 --> 00:41:29.807
Don't you want your child
to see the light of day?


00:41:31.151 --> 00:41:33.619
Tell me where HONG Lim is.


00:41:34.755 --> 00:41:39.920
I do not know.
Take my life if you must, sire.


00:41:41.261 --> 00:41:44.628
I can't let you die so easily.


00:41:46.667 --> 00:41:48.635
If you give a birth,


00:41:49.469 --> 00:41:53.530
I'll raise him as a son of
whom did high treason.


00:41:54.775 --> 00:41:57.403
You should see that.


00:41:59.846 --> 00:42:01.609
Talk to me.


00:42:04.751 --> 00:42:06.013
I don't know.


00:42:09.556 --> 00:42:14.118
I'm sorry.
I just want to hear from you.


00:42:22.769 --> 00:42:23.827
Let's go.


00:42:23.970 --> 00:42:25.437
Let me go.


00:42:25.572 --> 00:42:27.039
- Come on!
- What are you doing?


00:42:27.174 --> 00:42:29.642
- Let her go!
- Your Majesty!


00:42:29.776 --> 00:42:31.710
How dare you!


00:42:32.546 --> 00:42:34.104
What are you doing, Chief?


00:42:34.247 --> 00:42:36.010
Please listen to me.


00:42:36.149 --> 00:42:37.616
- Chief
- Where are you going, sir!


00:42:37.751 --> 00:42:41.118
- Chief!
- Chief!


00:42:42.055 --> 00:42:43.215
Out of my way!


00:42:43.457 --> 00:42:45.322
It's what the Queen wanted!


00:42:45.459 --> 00:42:46.926
Don't do this!


00:42:47.561 --> 00:42:48.721
Out of my way!


00:42:48.862 --> 00:42:51.729
Do you really think
you can save her?


00:42:51.865 --> 00:42:53.924
I came here because of you, sir.


00:42:54.067 --> 00:42:55.534
Please get off the horse.


00:42:55.969 --> 00:42:57.630
Out of my way, now!


00:42:58.572 --> 00:43:00.437
If you must, then go.


00:43:02.075 --> 00:43:03.133
But...


00:43:03.543 --> 00:43:05.704
What will you do
after bringing her here?


00:43:06.646 --> 00:43:08.807
All is lost.


00:43:09.449 --> 00:43:11.713
What can you do for her?


00:43:13.053 --> 00:43:15.214
Do you think
you can make her happy?


00:43:23.063 --> 00:43:28.330
- Chief!
- Chief!


00:45:10.070 --> 00:45:12.129
Where is HONG Lim?


00:45:15.876 --> 00:45:18.208
Where is HONG Lim?


00:45:21.448 --> 00:45:24.417
How much more
do you think you can endure?


00:45:25.552 --> 00:45:28.112
Tell me where he is!


00:45:38.765 --> 00:45:41.825
He already left.


00:45:43.470 --> 00:45:45.938
Why are you doing this?


00:45:47.674 --> 00:45:50.507
How dare you!


00:46:17.971 --> 00:46:20.235
Heads on stakes!


00:46:20.373 --> 00:46:23.604
There are heads on stakes!


00:48:11.151 --> 00:48:12.516
Today...


00:48:13.353 --> 00:48:18.120
in recognition of
our dispatched soldiers to Yuan...


00:48:18.258 --> 00:48:20.317
I have arranged this banquet.


00:48:20.760 --> 00:48:25.823
I will see to our soldiers
fighting for Goryeo alone.


00:48:26.366 --> 00:48:29.426
I want all of you
to mark this occasion.


00:48:29.569 --> 00:48:33.835
Drink to your hearts' content
and enjoy!


00:48:33.973 --> 00:48:37.500
Long live the King!


00:49:30.363 --> 00:49:33.526
You look exhausted, sire.


00:49:33.666 --> 00:49:35.827
Please retire to your chambers.


00:49:36.569 --> 00:49:39.732
Do you really think
Chief HONG will come?


00:50:18.044 --> 00:50:19.102
Your Majesty.


00:50:19.546 --> 00:50:24.609
Please take down the heads
hanging over the castle wall.


00:50:25.251 --> 00:50:28.015
'Tis not a matter of your concern.


00:50:28.755 --> 00:50:30.222
Now, go.


00:50:31.257 --> 00:50:34.420
Everything happened
as you wanted, sire!


00:50:35.562 --> 00:50:39.623
So, please let Chief HONG go.


00:50:42.068 --> 00:50:43.035
Sub-Chief?


00:50:44.170 --> 00:50:45.228
Yes, Your Majesty.


00:50:46.873 --> 00:50:49.433
Escort the Queen
to her chambers.


00:50:50.343 --> 00:50:51.605
Yes, sire.


00:51:39.158 --> 00:51:42.423
I shall leave in you peace.


00:51:45.865 --> 00:51:48.026
You're the only one left, now.


00:51:53.072 --> 00:51:54.039
Pardon?


00:51:54.774 --> 00:51:57.402
Everyone involved has died.


00:51:58.344 --> 00:52:00.812
You are the only one left.


00:52:01.547 --> 00:52:03.606
What do you mean, madam?


00:52:06.152 --> 00:52:10.919
You know perfectly why
Han-Baek and Bo-Duk were slain.


00:52:11.958 --> 00:52:16.918
Eventually, you will be silenced
in secrecy, too.


00:52:33.846 --> 00:52:37.407
There is no one else who can
stop His Majesty's madness.


00:52:38.251 --> 00:52:42.711
Release him from
his pains soon.


00:52:45.258 --> 00:52:47.123
I am the Princess of Yuan.


00:52:48.261 --> 00:52:50.525
If Lord Kyungwon succeeds
to the throne...


00:52:50.663 --> 00:52:55.327
I shall at least
guarantee your life.


00:53:19.158 --> 00:53:20.318
Out of my way.


00:53:21.160 --> 00:53:22.627
I came to see the King.


00:53:23.363 --> 00:53:27.629
Why'd you come here?
You're wanted for high treason.


00:53:28.167 --> 00:53:29.532
Let me through.


00:53:30.169 --> 00:53:31.329
We can't, sir.


00:53:32.171 --> 00:53:34.639
Please leave
before anyone sees you.


00:53:35.074 --> 00:53:36.905
I do not wish to strike you.


00:53:38.044 --> 00:53:39.102
Out of my way.


00:53:39.846 --> 00:53:40.813
No, sir!


00:53:51.357 --> 00:53:56.124
Chief, Han-Baek, and the others
were not traitors?


00:53:56.262 --> 00:54:00.221
If what you say is true,
it affects us, too.


00:54:00.366 --> 00:54:03.335
But why are you
telling us this, now?


00:54:03.469 --> 00:54:06.233
If I hadn't kept it
a secret till now...


00:54:07.073 --> 00:54:09.041
do you think you'd be alive?


00:54:15.148 --> 00:54:16.206
Chief HONG!


00:54:27.360 --> 00:54:30.420
Sir!
Chief HONG has returned!


00:54:30.963 --> 00:54:31.725
What?


00:54:31.864 --> 00:54:34.833
He's engaging the guard
at the court!


00:55:14.674 --> 00:55:16.801
Where have you been?


00:55:30.957 --> 00:55:33.517
You've been through a lot
haven't you?


00:55:43.769 --> 00:55:45.430
Why are you standing there?


00:55:46.772 --> 00:55:48.330
Come and sit by me.


00:55:50.243 --> 00:55:55.306
I came to take your life, sire.


00:55:59.552 --> 00:56:01.213
Pick up your sword, sire.


00:56:02.755 --> 00:56:05.315
It is my final show of respect.


00:56:08.961 --> 00:56:11.429
Why did you do it, sire?


00:56:14.367 --> 00:56:16.835
How can you do that
to the Queen?


00:56:20.473 --> 00:56:22.441
Pick up your sword, sire!


00:56:25.344 --> 00:56:27.005
You fool.


00:56:32.351 --> 00:56:34.512
Shall I strike first, sire?


00:56:35.655 --> 00:56:37.316
Stand up, Your Majesty.


00:56:53.673 --> 00:56:54.833
Fine.


00:56:55.975 --> 00:56:58.500
If killing me
will ease your anger...


00:57:00.746 --> 00:57:02.611
then try and kill me!


00:57:44.557 --> 00:57:46.923
Do you really think
you can beat me?


00:57:47.460 --> 00:57:50.020
I've been cut to my roots.


00:57:51.163 --> 00:57:56.032
There is nothing left
for me to fear.


00:58:17.356 --> 00:58:19.620
You castrated fool!


00:58:19.759 --> 00:58:21.727
Was love so important?


00:58:21.861 --> 00:58:24.523
You led me to feel love.


00:58:25.765 --> 00:58:27.630
I couldn't be more grateful!


00:59:37.269 --> 00:59:39.931
- Your Majesty!
- Stay back!


00:59:40.272 --> 00:59:44.606
Anyone who intervenes
will be the first to die!


00:59:45.244 --> 00:59:46.211
Sire!


01:00:16.575 --> 01:00:18.509
Nobody moves until I say so!


01:00:21.847 --> 01:00:23.906
I will give you one last chance.


01:00:24.950 --> 01:00:26.918
Drop your sword and surrender.


01:00:29.555 --> 01:00:32.023
Then I shall spare your life.


01:00:33.359 --> 01:00:35.020
It is too late, sire.


01:00:36.462 --> 01:00:38.327
Finish me, sire.


01:00:39.765 --> 01:00:40.823
Fine.


01:00:42.668 --> 01:00:44.135
I'll kill you.


01:01:07.259 --> 01:01:08.726
What is going on?


01:01:09.662 --> 01:01:11.823
You cannot enter, Your Majesty.


01:01:11.964 --> 01:01:13.226
Please go back.


01:01:28.247 --> 01:01:30.112
Let me ask you one thing.


01:01:31.750 --> 01:01:33.809
Have you, at least once...


01:01:35.254 --> 01:01:37.814
felt love for me?


01:01:43.562 --> 01:01:45.223
Have you...


01:01:46.665 --> 01:01:48.530
even once...


01:01:50.469 --> 01:01:53.233
thought me to be your love?


01:01:59.545 --> 01:02:00.910
No, sire.


01:02:04.350 --> 01:02:06.910
Not even once!


01:02:25.871 --> 01:02:27.532
Not yet!


01:04:12.044 --> 01:04:13.602
- Your Majesty!
- No!


01:04:13.746 --> 01:04:15.509
Out of my way!


01:04:21.253 --> 01:04:22.413
HONG Lim!


01:04:24.256 --> 01:04:25.518
HONG Lim!


01:04:26.658 --> 01:04:28.319
Escort the Queen
to her chambers!


01:04:28.460 --> 01:04:29.620
HONG Lim!


01:04:29.762 --> 01:04:32.629
Let go of me!


01:04:32.765 --> 01:04:35.029
HONG Lim!


01:04:35.167 --> 01:04:36.532
Take her, now!


01:04:37.269 --> 01:04:41.433
How dare you!
Let go of me!


01:04:41.573 --> 01:04:47.910
HONG Lim! HONG Lim!


01:05:28.854 --> 01:05:32.415
The King has just passed away
in the hands of an assassin.


01:05:33.559 --> 01:05:36.926
And we killed the assailant.


01:05:38.163 --> 01:05:40.222
Quickly move the bodies...


01:05:40.766 --> 01:05:43.826
and make sure
none of this gets out.


01:05:45.471 --> 01:05:46.631
Yes, sir.


01:06:28.347 --> 01:06:32.113
The palace looks really great
up here.


01:06:33.152 --> 01:06:34.210
Really?


01:06:35.754 --> 01:06:37.813
Do you know
where the court is?


01:06:38.657 --> 01:06:42.024
The court is your home, right?
Where is it?


01:06:42.561 --> 01:06:43.528
My home?


01:06:44.663 --> 01:06:47.029
My home is right there.


01:06:47.466 --> 01:06:48.524
What do you think?


01:06:48.667 --> 01:06:52.330
It's great.
I would love to live there.


01:06:52.471 --> 01:06:55.133
Then how about living together
in our entire life?


01:06:55.674 --> 01:06:56.902
Yes, Sire!

